            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Oh I think I am missing calling set up, I thought that would be done automatically for all at first.\r\n\r\nI placed this in `init.lua`:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"mini.surround\").setup()\r\nrequire(\"mini.completion\").setup()\r\nrequire(\"mini.basics\").setup()\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Oh I think I am missing calling set up, I thought that would be done automatically for all at first.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I placed this in <code class=\"notranslate\">init.lua</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require(&quot;mini.surround&quot;).setup()\nrequire(&quot;mini.completion&quot;).setup()\nrequire(&quot;mini.basics&quot;).setup()\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.surround<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>()\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.completion<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>()\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.basics<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>()</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "Oh I think I am missing calling set up, I thought that would be done automatically for all at first.\nI placed this in init.lua:\nrequire(\"mini.surround\").setup()\nrequire(\"mini.completion\").setup()\nrequire(\"mini.basics\").setup()",
